[
{
"id": 4465,
"en": "Game Rules",
"ctx": "manual|table/#//#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 4466,
"en": "<color=mg_relu_topic>Simultaneous Popping</color>\nPopping two or more Puyo groups at the same time will send more Garbage Puyos\nthan usual over to your opponent's side.\n\n<color=mg_relu_topic>All Clear</color>\nIf you pop every Puyo on your board, you will get what is called an All Clear.\nThis will greatly amplify the number of Garbage Puyos sent by your next chain. \n\n<color=mg_relu_topic>Game Over</color>\nYou lose when Puyos stack up and cover the <color=mg_relu_strong>X</color> at the upper middle of the board.\n",
"ctx": "manual|table/#//#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 4467,
"en": "<color=mg_relu_topic>Garbage Puyo Queue</color>\nThe Garbage Puyo Queue is displayed above your board.\nThis tells you how many Garbage Puyos will fall on your board\nafter your next non-chain move.\n\n<color=mg_relu_topic>Neutralizing</color>\nIf you pop a Puyo group while the Garbage Puyo Queue is active,\nyou can decrease the number of Garbage Puyos that will fall on your board.\nThis is known as neutralizing.\n",
"ctx": "manual|table/#//#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 4468,
"en": "<color=mg_relu_topic>Mission</color>\n　<color=mg_relu_point><symbol=bullet_point></color>Select a mission to begin a clan battle.\n<color=mg_relu_topic>Organization</color>\n　<color=mg_relu_point><symbol=bullet_point></color>Customize the organization and select a Strike Team.\n<color=mg_relu_topic>Training</color>\n　<color=mg_relu_point><symbol=bullet_point></color>Strengthen your leaders with Kiryu's experience points.\n<color=mg_relu_topic>Events</color>\n　<color=mg_relu_point><symbol=bullet_point></color>These missions are available only for a limited time.\n　<color=mg_relu_point><symbol=bullet_point></color>Make sure to check back each day to see how they change!\n<color=mg_relu_topic>Help</color>\n　<color=mg_relu_point><symbol=bullet_point></color>Review Clan Creator tutorials.",
"ctx": "manual|table/#//#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 4469,
"en": "The Clan Menu",
"ctx": "manual|table/#//#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 4470,
"en": "<color=mg_relu_topic>Expanding the Clan</color>\n　First, focus on gaining more members to strengthen\n the Kiryu Clan's influence! Scout them from around\n the city or make progress in the missions to acquire\n powerful new leaders. Substories may also lead to\n new recruits.\n\n<color=mg_relu_topic>Customize Your Organization</color>\n　Assigning roles to leaders in the clan will increase\n your influence, which raises the Deployment Gauge!\n You'll start with only enough room for six leaders,\n but when your organization levels up, you'll gain room\n for many more.",
"ctx": "manual|table/#//#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 4471,
"en": "Expanding the Kiryu Clan",
"ctx": "manual|table/#//#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 4472,
"en": "<color=mg_relu_topic>Leaders Need Men!</color>\n　As you expand a leader's command, his stats will increase by 10%. The more people he leads, the stronger \n he gets! If your leader has high compatibility with the men in his group, he may grow even stronger.",
"ctx": "manual|table/#//#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 4473,
"en": "Training Your Leaders",
"ctx": "manual|table/#//#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 4474,
"en": "<color=mg_relu_topic>Choose Which Leader to Deploy!</color>\n　You can choose to deploy up to six leaders into battle,\n but you can only select leaders who have been assigned\n a rank in the clan. Consider their stats and skills!\n\n<color=mg_relu_topic>The Leaders Change the Team!</color>\n　Each leader has his own men, and when you select one,\n he'll bring them into battle as the Strike Team. If men are\n assigned to multiple leaders, the deployment cost for that\n battle will be lower based on that number.",
"ctx": "manual|table/#//#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 4475,
"en": "The Strike Team",
"ctx": "manual|table/#//#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 4476,
"en": "<color=mg_relu_topic>Train Your Leaders to Win!</color>\n Leaders increase their stats by leveling up,\n to a max of 99.\n\n　<color=mg_relu_strong>Leveling Up Your Leaders</color>\n　　<color=mg_relu_point><symbol=bullet_point></color>Go on missions!\n　　<color=mg_relu_point><symbol=bullet_point></color>Use Kiryu's EXP!\n\n　　If you find a particular battle too difficult, it's probably\n   because your leaders need to grow stronger!",
"ctx": "manual|table/#//#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 4477,
"en": "Making the Clan Strong",
"ctx": "manual|table/#//#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 4478,
"en": "<color=mg_relu_topic>Controls</color>\n<color=mg_relu_point><symbol=bullet_point></color><color=mg_relu_strong><symbol=button_l_stick,Minigame_BattingCenter></color> will adjust your aim to the pitching machine's throw.\n<color=mg_relu_point><symbol=bullet_point></color><color=mg_relu_strong>Press <symbol=button_batsu,Minigame_BattingCenter></color> at the proper time to hit the ball.\n\n<color=mg_relu_topic>Clearing the Course</color>\n<color=mg_relu_point><symbol=bullet_point></color>Try to hit the ball toward the <color=mg_relu_strong>batting panel</color> inside the cages.\n<color=mg_relu_point><symbol=bullet_point></color>How many bases you get depends on <color=mg_relu_strong>where you hit the panel</color>.\n<color=mg_relu_point><symbol=bullet_point></color>Earn the specified total number of runs in <color=mg_relu_strong>10 balls or fewer</color> to clear the course.",
"ctx": "manual|table/#//#",
"max": null
},
